("The working personal system: done right","2025+","Speculative","Signature-generated speculative projection — not established fact. The frontier record: an extremely capable personal AI coordinating your whole digital life — loyal, transparent, and under your control.",("This record is the destination, not a description of anything built.","Loyalty, obedience, and care are the design goals.","Maturity moves only with verified demonstrations."),("Russell S. Human Compatible. Viking; 2019.","Amodei D. Machines of Loving Grace; 2024.")),
("Post-assistant: ambient intelligence","2025+","Speculative","Signature-generated speculative projection — not established fact. The assistant disappears into the environment; help arrives before you ask.",("Ambient computing has been a vision since the 1990s.","Proactive help risks constant interruption.","The final record: capability so embedded it is invisible."),("Weiser M. The Computer for the 21st Century. Scientific American; 1991.","Abowd G, Mynatt E. Charting past, present, and future research in ubiquitous computing. TOCHI; 2000.")),
